== OPEN-5: a Const takes the type of its value; `UInt8($FF)` makes Mask a
== UInt8 Const, usable where a UInt8 is expected.
Module ConstConversion

Const Mask := UInt8($FF)

Main :
    V UInt8 := Mask
    PutLn(V = Mask)
;
